{"id": "t057-002", "text": "Lunch with Obi today. He starts at the new firm on Monday and is a bit nervous about the commute. Remind me to text him Monday evening to see how the first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at the new firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous about the commute", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-003", "text": "Vanessa and Luca are having a housewarming on Saturday from 7pm. They've finally moved into the place on Elm Road after months of the sale falling through. Luca's mum will be there, and Vanessa warned me she asks everyone about their love life. Apparently they still have no sofa, so it's a bring-a-cushion situation. I'm getting the train, so leave by 6.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday from 7pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved into the place on Elm Road", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "asks everyone about their love life", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "leave", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 6", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-009", "text": "Call with Tunde this morning. His last day at the bank is a week on Friday and the leaving drinks are at the Crown afterwards, from about half 5. Don't forget to chip in for the card and present, Gemma is collecting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week on Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards, from about half 5", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in for the card and present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t057-010", "text": "Esme is having a really rough time at the new job. Her manager keeps piling things on and she's not sleeping much. She said she's thinking of quitting before Christmas but is worried about money, since her partner Obi is between contracts too. Should check in with her over the weekend, maybe suggest a walk on Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rough time at the new job", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping much", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quitting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about money", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "between contracts", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "suggest a walk", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t057-014", "text": "Zofia's mum is turning seventy in a fortnight and the whole family is going to Kraków for the weekend to celebrate. Zofia is in charge of the cake and is stressing about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning seventy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t057-019", "text": "Vikram started at the hospital trust yesterday. He said the induction was mostly fire safety videos but the team seem lovely.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vikram", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at the hospital trust", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t057-022", "text": "Caitlin's brother Connor got into the fire service. Their mum is over the moon. Caitlin said he starts training in January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the fire service", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "training", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t057-025", "text": "Spoke to Dawit on the phone. His dad retires on Friday after forty years as a bus driver, and they're doing a family lunch on Sunday at 1. Dawit's quite emotional about it. I should get a card for his dad and ask Dawit to pass it on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "forty years as a bus driver", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "family lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite emotional", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card for his dad and ask Dawit to pass it on", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t057-028", "text": "Gym at 6:30 tomorrow morning, then the boiler engineer is coming between 12 and 4.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Gym", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6:30 tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "between 12 and 4", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t057-034", "text": "Luca's partner Adriana is turning forty on the 3rd. Luca wants to do a surprise dinner at that Italian place on Tuesday the 2nd and asked if I can keep the evening free. I said yes. He's also asked me to sort the cake, which I'm doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning forty", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner at that Italian place", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday the 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t057-037", "text": "Obi's wife Kasia had her baby on Tuesday morning! A little boy, Tobi. Remind me to send something, maybe a babygrow and a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t057-039", "text": "Lachlan told me he's been offered a promotion to team lead but isn't sure he wants it. He has to decide by next Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion to team lead", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't sure he wants it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decide", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by next Wednesday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t057-044", "text": "Karan and Noor are throwing a joint thirtieth on Saturday the 18th, starting at 8. Dress code is 'something gold'. I need to find something gold.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint thirtieth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 18th, starting at 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find something gold", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t057-045", "text": "Talked to Connor after the match. His mum retires next month and he's trying to plan a party but his sisters can't agree on anything. He's a bit frazzled. One sister wants a quiet meal, the other wants a marquee in the garden with a band. Their mum just wants a new set of golf clubs, by the sound of it. Connor asked if I'd be up for helping with invitations next weekend, which I'm happy to do.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the match"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sisters", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit frazzled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a new set of golf clubs", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend"}]}
{"id": "t057-047", "text": "Suzanne said her husband just started a new job at a solar company and absolutely loves it. Their kids are thrilled he's not working weekends anymore.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at a solar company", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not working weekends", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t057-051", "text": "Sam's engagement party is next Saturday at the cricket club. Her fiancé Dawit is from Addis, so his family are flying in on Thursday. She asked if I could help set up from 4. I need to remember to bring the fairy lights and the extension lead. Also find out whether Dawit's parents speak much English, so I can at least learn hello in Amharic before Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiancé", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Addis", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring the fairy lights and the extension lead", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find out whether Dawit's parents speak much English", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "learn hello in Amharic", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Saturday", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t057-052", "text": "Emil's last day at the agency was Friday. He's taking a month off before starting his own studio. Must remember to ask him in a couple of weeks how the studio plans are going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day at the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "month off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "own studio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a couple of weeks", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-054", "text": "Caitlin's housewarming was lovely. Her new place has a garden at last, and her little boy loved the swing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a garden", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t057-055", "text": "Aarav's mum is coming out of hospital tomorrow after the knee operation. He's taking the week off to look after her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aarav", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming out of hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee operation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t057-058", "text": "Long chat with Esme tonight. Her brother Lachlan has been offered a job in Toronto and is flying out in a fortnight for a final interview. Their dad isn't well, so Esme is worried about him being so far away. She's also hosting Sunday lunch for the family this weekend and asked if I could come at 12 to help with the cooking. I should bring wine and maybe a pudding.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job in Toronto", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Sunday lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "12"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring wine and maybe a pudding", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t057-060", "text": "Quiet weekend planned. Going to finally sort the spare room and maybe do a long walk on Sunday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "weekend"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning"}]}
